  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Website Outline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We’ll want to create a space that reflects Trica’s intellectual rigor, interdisciplinary work, and public engagement. A few key considerations:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Core Website Goals**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Professional Presence**: A polished, authoritative site that highlights her academic achievements, research, and media appearances."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Audience Engagement**: The site should be accessible to scholars, students, journalists, and the general public interested in Black studies, race, and identity politics."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Clear Navigation**: Visitors should easily find her books, articles, speaking engagements, and contact information."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Aesthetic Balance**: A minimalist, modern design with strong typography to reflect her intellectual authority, while also allowing for visually engaging elements (photos, media clips, book covers)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Key Sections & Content**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Home Page**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "~~A high-quality, professional photo of he~~r (or something abstract but meaningful)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A concise but powerful introduction (who she is, what she does)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Highlights of her latest book or research"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A strong call-to-action (book purchase links, media inquiries, contact)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**About / Bio**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "~~A high-resolution portrait~~"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A compelling bio that’s both professional and engaging"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Academic credentials, major awards, and affiliations"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Books & Publications**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Cover images, descriptions, and purchase links"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Reviews, endorsements, and interviews discussing her work"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Academic articles or PDFs where possible"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Research & Projects**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
