    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Contact & Social Media**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A simple, professional contact form"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Links to academic profiles (Dartmouth, Google Scholar, etc.)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Social media (if applicable)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Design & Aesthetic**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Color Palette**: A sophisticated, intellectual color scheme (deep blues, burgundy, earth tones, or monochrome)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Typography**: Serif fonts for authority (Garamond, Times New Roman), paired with a clean sans-serif for clarity (Montserrat, Lato)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Layout**: Minimalist, well-spaced, with strong use of imagery and whitespace"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Visual Elements**: Subtle animations, book mockups, and a structured grid layout"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Technical & SEO Considerations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Mobile Optimization**: Ensure the site is responsive"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**SEO Best Practices**: Optimize for her name and keywords like \"Black France,\" \"antiblackness in Europe,\" \"race and identity politics\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Fast Load Times**: Use optimized images and clean code"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Accessibility**: Ensure screen-reader compatibility and high contrast for readability"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}